Third-party data
----------------

The HackerTube catalog ingested by `hackertube ingest` is the public dataset
from HackerTube (https://hackertube.org), released under the Open Data Commons
Attribution License (ODC-By) v1.0:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/

Credit HackerTube (https://hackertube.org) and the
open-index/hacker-news dataset (https://huggingface.co/datasets/open-index/hacker-news).
Hacker News data is provided by Y Combinator. Comments remain the work of
their authors. Video titles and channel names belong to their creators.

This project is not affiliated with YouTube, Google, Hacker News, or
Y Combinator.

AI Engineer talk pages and transcripts are fetched from https://ai.engineer
(and, when a snapshot uses that format, https://aietalks.com). They remain
the work of their speakers and publishers. The CLI caches them locally and
does not redistribute them.

Embeddings shipped inside the HackerTube dataset were produced with
BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5. New vectors use the same model via fastembed when
that extra is installed.
